 ('anthem-summary','Anthem','Wikipedia contributors','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthem_(novella)','secondary_reference','Assigned occupations, collective housing, coercive Councils and electric-light discovery.','Communal housing is not secure unconditional entitlement; no all-age useful-work census.'),
 ('directive','Ayn Rand and the Bill of Rights','Marilyn Moore, The Atlas Society','https://www.atlassociety.org/post/ayn-rand-and-the-bill-of-rights','secondary_analysis','Directive 10-289 freezes jobs and innovation under the Unification Board.','Ideologically committed literary commentary; a generic employment/invention freeze does not establish a demonstrated labor-replacing production alternative.'),
 ('landscape', 'Landscape With Invisible Hand','M. T. Anderson, author website','https://mtanderson.com/books/landscape-with-invisible-hand','author_summary','Alien technology replaces human jobs while ordinary humans lack money for food, water and medical access.','The bounded author/publisher description establishes exclusion but not a human activity percentage or an exact alien ownership census.'),
