 ('novapreview','Nova Praxis: Savage Worlds Edition, preview pp. 9–11','Mike McConnell and Void Star Studios',''+NOVA,'official_rulebook_excerpt','Citizens receive a default resource standard and usually own compilers; reputation governs extras. Apostates barter/scavenge, may labor for citizenship, and lack Coalition resources. Purists restrict bodily augmentation.','Bounded overview pages only, not the entire rulebook. Uploaded active humans are a disclosed proxy. Monitors serve government and Mimir has shut down, so neither is assumed to be a sovereign provider.'),
 ('extropia','Eclipse Phase first-edition core, indexed pp. 62–78','Posthuman Studios; excerpt indexed at AnyFlip','https://anyflip.com/kjxas/cses/basic/51-100','indexed_rulebook_excerpt','Cornucopia production coexists with Extropian private property, contractual law/security and AGI legal facilitation.','The direct page produced a cache error; use is limited to indexed passage and first-edition quoted material, without importing the second-edition entitlement rules.'),
